<title>USA: PRIMARK UNIT WINS LONDON EXCHANGE CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>PRIMARK UNIT WINS LONDON EXCHANGE CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primark Corp said Friday that its Disclosure unit has won a contract with the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It make available to third parties full text documents submitted by companies to the London Stock Exchange's Company Announcements Office.</p>
<p>Disclosure began providing services on behalf of the London Stock Exchange on July 7, Primark said.</p>
<p>The unit has been providing similar services for the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for almost 30 years, it said.</p>
<p>Terms of Disclosure's contract with the London Stock Exchange were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
